cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FigureOut: a lightweight and resilient multi-LLM orchestrator"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Balajee
    family-names: Kalyanasundaram
    email: kalyanasundarambalajee@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-7292-2417"
repository-code: https://github.com/balajeekalyan/figureout
url: https://github.com/balajeekalyan/figureout
abstract: >-
  FigureOut is a lightweight, modular orchestrator for developers who want to
  build LLM workflows without the framework bloat. It classifies incoming
  queries and dispatches them to the appropriate role, returning a structured
  JSON response. Supports OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Meta, Mistral, and Groq
  with optional MCP tool integration.
